ΩDuring the weekends, from 21/11 to 6/12 Infrabel is working on the track. An SNCB-NMBS bus replaces most IC trains Mouscron / Moeskroen - Namur / Namen - Liers between Charleroi-Central and Tamines. An SNCB-NMBS bus replaces most S61 trains Wavre / Waver - Charleroi-Central - Jambes between Chatelet and Tamines. The travel planner takes these changes into account. The departure times of the NMBS buses are subject to traffic conditions. The journey time may therefore be extended. O√π prendre mon bus ? Waar is mijn bushalte? O√π prendre mon bus ? Waar is mijn bushalte?en